## Workspace components
#

# JavaScript and TypeScript configuration template repository name.
jsmap
# Shared base configuration repository name, plus the seat it is written as.
# > caseSensitive is on, so the prose form needs its own line.
map
Map
# Python configuration template repository name.
pymap
# Reusable Python toolkit repository name.
pykit
# Engineering publication repository name, plus the seat it is written as.
chrono
Chrono

#
## Internal shorthands and acronyms
#

# Repository agent-memory integration shorthand.
agentsmemory
# BetterTouchTool preset name scoped by a repository decision.
bttpreset
# Internal error-construction shorthand.
errorfactory
# Uppercase form of the LoopX control plane, used in spec file names.
LOOPX
# Uppercase form of MindFS, used in spec file names.
MINDFS
# Multi-repository workspace shorthand.
multirepo
# Project-specific developer tooling shorthand.
nefrob
# Project-specific acronym retained by the tooling configuration.
ntid
# Operating-system operations shorthand.
osops
# Internal shorthand for excessive claims or behavior.
overclaim
# Camel-case fragment of the retired Copilot Telegram extension's secret keys.
Tele
# Retired name of the Copilot Telegram bridge, still read for stored secrets.
telepilot
# Project-specific developer tooling shorthand.
ttfe
